{
 "title": "阅读分级题库",
 "html": "<div>\n  <div>\n    <h1>阅读程序分级题库</h1>\n    <div>\n      <span><span>所属模块</span> 初赛深化</span><span><span>题型</span> 阅读程序</span><span><span>出题类型</span> 拉分大题</span><span><span>难度</span> <span>★★★★☆</span></span><span><span>必练指数</span> ★★★★★</span>    </div>\n\n    <h2 id=\"concept\">基础概念</h2>\n    <div><div><span>基</span>通俗讲解</div><p>阅读程序题给一段 C++ 代码，问<strong>输出结果 / 时间复杂度 / 功能</strong>。核心能力是<strong>变量追踪</strong>：在草稿纸列出关键变量每一步的值。本题按难度分三档，建议从入门练到压轴。</p></div>\n    <h2 id=\"basic\">入门档 · 循环与输出</h2>\n    <div><div><span>基础</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>变量追踪。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int s=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=5;i++) s+=i*i;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;s;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：1²+2²+3²+4²+5² = 55。</div></div><div><div><span>基础</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>注意循环条件。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int a=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(a&lt;100) a*=2;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;a;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：a 依次 1,2,4,8,16,32,64,128，输出 128（首个 ≥100 的 2 的幂）。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"mid\">进阶段 · 递归与数组</h2>\n    <div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>递归展开。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int f(int n){ return n&lt;=1 ? 1 : f(n-1)+f(n-2); }</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;f(6);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：f(6)=斐波那契第 7 项 = 1,1,2,3,5,8,13 → 输出 13。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序功能？</span></div><div><p>判断意图。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int cnt=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=2;i&lt;n;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  if(n%i==0) cnt++;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;cnt;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：统计 n 的真因子个数（不含 1 和自身）；cnt==0 时 n 为质数。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"hard\">压轴档 · 模拟与 DP 追踪</h2>\n    <div><div><span>压轴</span><span>以下程序时间复杂度？</span></div><div><p>复杂度估计。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  for(int j=i;j&lt;=n;j++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>    sum+=a[i][j];</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：内层 j 从 i 到 n，总次数 ≈ n²/2，复杂度 O(n²)。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>以下程序输出（n=4）？</span></div><div><p>DP 填表追踪。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int f[5]={0};</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=4;i++) f[i]=f[i-1]+i;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;f[4];</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：f[i]=前 i 项和，f[4]=1+2+3+4=10。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"extra\">加练档 · 易混陷阱</h2>\n    <div><div><span>基础</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>计数 1~8 中的偶数。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int x=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=8;i++) if(i%2==0) x++;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;x;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：偶数有 2,4,6,8 共 4 个，输出 4。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>排序后按下标取数。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int a[]={3,1,4,1,5};</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>sort(a,a+5);</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;a[2];</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：排序后为 1,1,3,4,5，a[2]=3，输出 3。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>以下程序计算什么？</span></div><div><p>经典 DP 跟踪。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int best=-1000000000, cur=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  cur = max(a[i], cur + a[i]);</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  best = max(best, cur);</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; best;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<b>最大子段和</b>（Kadane 算法）。cur 维护以 i 结尾的最大子段，best 取全局最大。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"more2\">加练档二 · 递归与位运算</h2>\n    <div><div><span>基础</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>统计二进制中 1 的个数（Brian Kernighan 技巧）。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int x=13, c=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(x){ x = x &amp; (x-1); c++; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; c;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：13 = 1101，共 3 个 1，输出 <b>3</b>。x&(x-1) 每次消去最低位的 1。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>递归求幂。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int pw(int a,int b){ return b==0 ? 1 : a * pw(a,b-1); }</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; pw(2,5);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：2⁵ = <b>32</b>；时间复杂度 O(b)，注意幂大时可能溢出。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>汉诺塔步数递推。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>long h(int n){ return n==1 ? 1 : 2*h(n-1)+1; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; h(3);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：h(3)=2·h(2)+1=2·3+1=<b>7</b>。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>lowbit：取出最低位的 1。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int lowbit(int x){ return x &amp; -x; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; lowbit(12);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：12 = 1100，-12 补码与 12 相与得 100(二进制)= <b>4</b>。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"more3\">加练档三 · 数论与算法追踪</h2>\n    <div><div><span>基础</span><span>输入 n=10，以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>统计 3 的倍数个数。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int c=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) if(i%3==0) c++;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; c;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：3,6,9 共 <b>3</b> 个。</div></div><div><div><span>基础</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>阶乘计算。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int f=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=2;i&lt;=5;i++) f*=i;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; f;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：5! = 1·2·3·4·5 = <b>120</b>。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>欧几里得求最大公约数。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int g(int a,int b){ while(b){ int t=a%b; a=b; b=t; } return a; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; g(12,18);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：gcd(12,18)=<b>6</b>。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>输入 n=123，以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>整数反转。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int r=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(n){ r=r*10+n%10; n/=10; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; r;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：逐位取末位拼到 r，123 → <b>321</b>。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>以下程序输出？</span></div><div><p>找最小值下标。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int a[]={5,2,9,1};</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>int m=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;4;i++) if(a[i]&lt;a[m]) m=i;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; m;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：最小值 1 在最后一个下标，输出 <b>3</b>。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>以下程序输出（n=20）？</span></div><div><p>筛质数个数。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int c=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=2;i&lt;=20;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  int f=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  for(int j=2;j*j&lt;=i;j++) if(i%j==0) f=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>  c+=f;</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; c;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：20 以内质数 2,3,5,7,11,13,17,19 共 <b>8</b> 个。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>对有序数组 a 查找 x，该程序？</span></div><div><p>二分查找存在性。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int l=0,r=n-1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(l&lt;=r){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  int m=(l+r)/2;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  if(a[m]==x) return 1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>  else if(a[m]&lt;x) l=m+1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>  else r=m-1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td><span>return 0;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：找到返回 1，否则 0；最坏复杂度 <b>O(log n)</b>。条件务必用 l<=r。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"tip\">高分技巧</h2>\n    <div><div><span>技</span>速算捷径</div><p>① 先扫一遍猜\"功能\"；② 小数据手算前几步；③ 复杂度看双层循环的边界；④ 遇到递归先写出前两三项再归纳。</p></div>\n    <h2 id=\"mnemonic\">记忆口诀</h2>\n    <div><div><span>技</span>📌 口诀</div><p><b>\"阅读程序莫慌张，草稿追踪变量忙；先猜功能再手算，复杂度看循环框。\"</b></p></div>  </div>\n    <div>\n    <div id=\"toc\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div><h2 id=\"quiz\">📝 本节自测<span>共 6 题</span></h2><p>做完点「提交本节自测」即时判分；单选 / 多选 / 填空混合，答错可一键收入错题本。</p><div id=\"selfQuizBox\"><div><div>阅读程序题第一步应？ <span>易</span></div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rdb1\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>明确输入输出与题目数据范围</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rdb1\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>直接运行</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rdb1\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>改写</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rdb1\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>猜结果</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>先理解输入输出。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>估算程序复杂度时，关注最 ____ 的循环嵌套（填“深/外层”）。 <span>填空题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>深</b></div><div>最内层决定量级。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>阅读程序常考能力有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>难</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_rdb3[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>模拟执行</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_rdb3[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>复杂度分析</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_rdb3[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>边界判断</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_rdb3[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>美术排版</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>阅读程序考查模拟执行、复杂度分析、边界判断；美术排版与解题无关。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>阅读程序写结果题，常用的分析方法有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>列变量追踪表</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>手算小样例验证</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>数学归纳找规律</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>凭感觉乱猜</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>追踪表 + 小样例 + 归纳规律是稳妥三板斧。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>CSP 初赛（普及/提高）满分通常为 ____ 分。（填空） <span>填空题</span> <span>易</span></div><div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>100</b></div><div>初赛满分一般为 <b>100 分</b>。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>关于初赛，正确的认识有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>难</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>选择题错选会倒扣分数</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>阅读程序分值高需重点练</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>带计算器进考场更高效</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>复赛才考编程，初赛不考</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABD</b></div><div>错选倒扣、阅读程序占比高都是事实；<b>计算器通常不允许</b>，复赛才动手编程。</div><div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div id=\"selfReport\"></div></div><div><div><a href=\"code_pattern.php\"><div>← 上一题</div><div>阅读程序代码模式识别</div></a><a href=\"fill_bank.php\"><div>下一题 →</div><div>程序填空分类题库</div></a></div></div><div><div><h3>🔗 相关考点推荐</h3><div><a href=\"../../knowledge/paper/code_pattern.php\">阅读程序代码模式识别</a><a href=\"../../knowledge/paper/fill_bank.php\">程序填空分类题库</a><a href=\"../../knowledge/logic/base_system.php\">进制与数制系统</a><a href=\"../../knowledge/logic/binary_convert.php\">进制互化</a><a href=\"../../knowledge/cpp/datatype_range.php\">数据类型与取值范围</a><a href=\"../../knowledge/cpp/operator_priority.php\">运算符优先级与逻辑短路</a></div></div></div><div><div><h3>🧭 学习路径</h3><div><div><span>📚 前置</span><div><a href=\"../../knowledge/paper/code_pattern.php\">阅读程序代码模式识别</a><a href=\"../../knowledge/paper/read_program.php\">阅读程序四步法</a></div></div><div><span>📍 本页</span><div><span>阅读程序分级题库</span>